// One host Newton beams a note, "Northbound", over the LAN medium while two
// others listen (ctests host.NewtonBeamLANTwoReceivers and its Sharp IR
// twin: tools/host/twonewtons.py --lan with beam-lan-listen.ns on both of
// the others).  As with IR, only one of them takes it.  The protocol is
// NEWTON_BEAM_TOOL's (beamhelpers.ns).
HostInclude("beamhelpers.ns");
call beamSendNote with ("Northbound", "hello from the first Newton", func() begin
	Print("beam-lan-send: done");
	HostQuit();
end);
